# Accepted Trivy findings, for the image scan (image-scan.yml) and the
# misconfiguration scan (ci.yml). Each entry needs a reason and an expiry;
# Trivy reports the finding again once the date passes.

# filelock CVE-2026-112940 in the aaru-web image: fixed only in filelock 4.2.1,
# but every unstructured release requires filelock<4. Exploiting it needs local
# write access to the lock directory; the container runs read-only with no
# other users. Same exception as CorpLynx/aaru-web's .trivyignore.
CVE-2026-112940 exp:2027-01-31
